## codec-loop — files derived from the OpenAI Codex plugin for Claude Code

Two files are derived from the OpenAI Codex plugin for Claude Code
(https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc), Copyright 2026 OpenAI, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The full licence text is in
LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

- `skills/codec-review/references/review-prompt.md` — derived from the plugin's
  `prompts/adversarial-review.md`. Modified: reshaped into a round-1 brief
  template with a verified-facts block, adapted to a multi-round loop on one
  Codex thread, and extended with loop-specific guidance.
- `skills/codec-review/references/review-output.schema.json` — derived from the
  plugin's `schemas/review-output.schema.json`. Modified: added the `settled`
  field and reworked the finding fields (`id`, `what_breaks`, `why_vulnerable`,
  `impact`, `recommendation`, `confidence`, `file`, `line_start`, `line_end`,
  `prior_round_response`).

